# GitHub reads this for its "Cite this repository" button, and Zenodo when it
# archives a release. Edit this file only: the citesync hook fails while
# .zenodo.json disagrees with it, and
# `prek run citesync-write --hook-stage manual --all-files` rewrites .zenodo.json to match.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "Observability stack"
abstract: "Central OpenTelemetry observability stack for CML research platforms: Grafana, Loki, Tempo, Prometheus"
authors:
